      "updated": 1756261210704,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Logistic Regression (LR) → Linear model that computes w · x + b and squashes\nwith a sigmoid to get probability. Lightweight, interpretable.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Logistic Regression (LR) → Linear model that computes w · x + b and squashes with a sigmoid to get probability. Lightweight, interpretable.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
